            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Cybernetic Speed](item_6e88739f-7e7e-4e01-ba55-2e3c62c949ec) provides free attack speed and is generally strong. The effect is very noticeable when you have all stacks active.  \n\n[Sacred Shuriken](item_b32b34a9-0163-4092-875e-3a9817b7df54) is great if you can consistently farm enemies, since they stack, or if there\u2019s an easy-to-hit tank. This generates a lot of extra cash.  \n\n## Items\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) offers the highest damage for the cost, and the armor effect is useful since Genji\u2019s projectiles deal relatively low damage.  \n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is valuable for farming the 100 HP before engaging, giving you a strong duel or initiation.  \n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is excellent for poking and provides a bit more HP. It works especially well against heroes like Rein, D.Va, or Sigma, who can\u2019t quite sustain through poke \u2014 really, any easy-to-hit targets.  \n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is also strong for overhealth. It\u2019s fairly easy to trigger and makes your Blade deal 20% more damage (this applies to both AP and WP).  \n\nIf you have plenty of money, you should outright buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).",
