            "notes": "## Items\n\nYou can choose again between the damage item that you think is best for the current situation. I usually like [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) because Genji has a pretty easy time getting the 100 HP overhealth. It also makes blade do 20% more damage since blade counts as AP and WP.\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is the more poke-oriented option.\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) should again be bought if there's money for it.",
