            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Sacred Shuriken](item_b32b34a9-0163-4092-875e-3a9817b7df54) provides more poke\u2014great if there are easy-to-shoot tanks. The damage is high enough that enemies sometimes outright die from 1\u20132 left-click headshots. Get into the habit of left-clicking more often, even at close range\u2014only right-click if you are point blank. This also helps farm money.  \n\n[Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) is strong against squishy targets like Ashe or Soldier, where you need to play more like an assassin.  \n\n## Items\n\nI usually take [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) because it boosts attack speed and adds a bit of HP. If possible, buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).  \n\nThis is also the first round where I\u2019d consider buying a defensive item like [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c). It essentially works as a flat 20% damage reduction. [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is a similar option\u2014cheaper, with a bit more attack power.",
