            "notes": "## Items\n\nThis round, you really need [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) because you\u2019re starting to run out of slots.  \n\nYou may also want to buy [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) if you\u2019re dying too quickly.  \n\nReplace [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) with [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you have enough money.  \n\nYou can also take [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) over [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if it frees up space for other items.",
