        {
            "id": "d13587f9-7be0-4ed1-8fe3-c6507c02be72",
            "build_id": "af20c657-7def-4b38-b8d0-7af520033529",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-20T00:49:29.54674+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Forged Under Fire](item_b60b1aa3-e69d-4d19-b3d8-43de1cce110c) is usually my favorite because it can heal half your HP at times.  \n\n[Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) is a good option if you need more damage to kill squishy targets or you aren\u2019t under much pressure.  \n\n## Items\n\nIn most games, you need [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a), and [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) as your core damage items. At this stage, you also need to get a defensive item because there just aren\u2019t enough useful offensive ones left. Usually, I take [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) if you don\u2019t already have one.  \n\nThe last slot should replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you have the money for it. If the enemy team doesn\u2019t have armor, you can also sell Codebreaker instead\u2014this may open up space for another epic item:  \n\n- [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) is obviously stronger in every way, though more expensive.  \n- [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) gives slightly more HP and might help prevent being blown up instantly.  \n- [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) almost always brings you to 15\u201320% WP since you use dash, and it also gives 10% CDR, which is useful.  \n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) adds 25 more HP.",
